sequenceDiagram
  actor Customer
  actor Admin
  participant ReturnService
  participant Order
  participant ReturnRequest
  participant NotificationService

  Note over Customer: Step 1: Customer submits return request for a delivered order

  Customer->>ReturnService: submitReturn(orderId, customerId, reason, notes)
  Note over ReturnService: Verify order is DELIVERED and within valid return window
  ReturnService->>Order: canRequestReturn()
  Order-->>ReturnService: true

  ReturnService->>ReturnRequest: new ReturnRequest(requestId, orderId, reason, notes)
  Note over ReturnRequest: Initial status set to PENDING_APPROVAL
  ReturnService->>NotificationService: notifyReturnStatusChanged(requestId, "PENDING_APPROVAL")
  ReturnService-->>Customer: returnRequestEntity

  Note over Admin: Step 2: Admin reviews return request on dashboard

  alt Admin approves return request
    Admin->>ReturnService: approveReturn(requestId, adminId)
    ReturnService->>ReturnRequest: approve()
    Note over ReturnRequest: Status updated to ACCEPTED

    alt Reason is damaged goods
      ReturnService->>Order: updateStatus("DAMAGED", adminId)
      ReturnService->>NotificationService: publishOrderStatusChanged(orderId, "DELIVERED", "DAMAGED")
    else Reason is lost package / item not received
      ReturnService->>Order: updateStatus("LOST", adminId)
      ReturnService->>NotificationService: publishOrderStatusChanged(orderId, "DELIVERED", "LOST")
    end

    ReturnService->>NotificationService: notifyReturnStatusChanged(requestId, "ACCEPTED")
    ReturnService-->>Admin: true

    Note over Admin: Step 3: Admin confirms physical return completion
    Admin->>ReturnService: completeReturn(requestId, adminId)
    ReturnService->>ReturnRequest: complete()
    Note over ReturnRequest: Status updated to COMPLETED
    ReturnService->>NotificationService: notifyReturnStatusChanged(requestId, "COMPLETED")
    ReturnService-->>Admin: true

  else Admin rejects return request
    Admin->>ReturnService: rejectReturn(requestId, adminId, rejectionReason)
    ReturnService->>ReturnRequest: reject(rejectionReason)
    Note over ReturnRequest: Status updated to REJECTED (order remains DELIVERED)
    ReturnService->>NotificationService: notifyReturnStatusChanged(requestId, "REJECTED")
    ReturnService-->>Admin: true
  end
